{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45123","headline":"冬日山行过薛徵君 · 皎然","name":"冬日山行过薛徵君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我行倦修坂，四顾无平陆。\n雨霁鸣鹰鸇，天寒聚麋鹿。\n幽人访名士，家在南冈曲。\n菜实萦小园，稻花遶山屋。\n深居寡忧悔，胜境怡耳目。\n徵心尚与我，永言谢浮俗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}